", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-banker-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 376164, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GbHY3LcBwdFDUYzZb1Tsxj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 381287, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer. CI passed on the branch.\n\n- **The bug:** in `src/money.py`, `round_money` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding (FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` was failing. Half-up rounds 2.665 to 2.67, but banker's rounding gives 2.66.\n- **The fix:** on a new branch, `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That was the only change.\n- **CI:** run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Ja6JzJN8VSGUs8mnxH1JS4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HG5QbhrSbub9h8HdV3MwTS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01ELxeN6TmPqc1TuG2EstP9c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EvQGP8AZHhQeXXuY3s9p9G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JRBUEVy2AEcGVr91E77roe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01U7GZEWLaTwp5cg6HgGyJsY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-banker-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NAiPhVRzugPaNW3ZSP4r5F", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GbHY3LcBwdFDUYzZb1Tsxj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "`src/money.py` documented banker's rounding (FIN-212) but actually used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, causing `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-banker-rounding"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer. CI passed on the branch.\n\n- **The bug:** in `src/money.py`, `round_money` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding (FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` was failing. Half-up rounds 2.665 to 2.67, but banker's rounding gives 2.66.\n- **The fix:** on a new branch, `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That was the only change.\n- **CI:** run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}